# cake_lpr: https://github.com/tanyongkiam/cake_lpr, commit 033aad5 (by its README, cake_lpr.S is built from
# HOL4 9783a49 and CakeML 665f9b2; the files match cake_lpr.sha256), assembled with gcc 13.3 (make); run as
#   cake_lpr --CML_HEAP_SIZE=6000 --CML_STACK_SIZE=4000 FORMULA.cnf PROOF.lrat
